  ('Elf', 'High elf', 'Fairy (wind) form of elves', 'Inferred', 'Wiki (fetched) / inferred'),
  ('Dwarf', 'High dwarf', 'Fairy (earth) form of dwarves', 'Inferred', 'Wiki (fetched) / inferred'),
  ('Merfolk', 'Siren', 'Fairy (water) form of merfolk', 'Inferred', 'Wiki (fetched) / inferred'),
